Welcome to the simple and automated installation repository for Discord Token Generator (DiscordTokenGenerator) on Windows PC. If you are developing communication bots, testing chat application integrations, or simply want an easy, lightweight desktop utility to automatically structure, manage, and verify unique session keys and API tokens in one clean place, this standalone tool is exactly what you need.

