Key Features:
Centralized Token Dashboard: Easily view, generate, and organize your custom API development tokens from a clean, unified interface.
Ultra-Lightweight Engine: Uses minimal RAM and CPU resources, ensuring your computer stays completely fast while running backend scripts.
One-Click Session Refresh: Instantly verify your local communication data paths and apply new structural formats with a single click, saving you time.
Safe & Independent: Built strictly using standard offline character string algorithms and local file management, making it reliable for everyday use.

